jobs.description:
Responsibilities

Manage Corporate Client implementations of transaction banking product for clients, range from SME to Large Local Corporates, and Multi-national clients;
Responsible for delivery multi-products including payment, receivable and liquidity management with various electronic channels including internet banking, Host-to-Host, API, SWIFT/CIPS based direct connection solutions to Corporates;
Coordinate with internal and external stakeholders to ensure timely project managementand seamless implementation process, as well as building solid relationships with corporate clients;
Provide sales support and facilitate client’s specific customized requirements;
Provide timely update on project plans and status report;
Responsible for driving new product roll out in relation to transaction banking and digital platform.

Requirements

5 years or above hands-on experience in Transaction Banking Product Management and Corporate Electronic Channel Management, familiar with Transaction Banking products and channels, with experience in product development, revamp and marketing is preferred;
Degree holder in Business, Economic, Information Technology or Marketing discipline preferable;
Solid knowledge and understanding of transaction banking products on payments, receivable and liquidity solutions and electronic channels includes internet banking, Host-to-Host, API, SWIFT and CIPS;
Self-motivated person with strong project management skills with attentiveness to detail, be able to work independently and under pressure to meet tight schedule;
High level of customer centricity mindset with dedication to deliver exceptional quality services for customers;
Good communication skill and proficiency in both English and Chinese, with fluency in Putonghua an advantage;
Candidates with less experience will be considered as Product Manager.

We offer competitive remuneration package and comprehensive fringe benefits including medical and life insurance, and different types of allowances to the right candidates. Interested parties, please submit your application online. For details, please visit our website http://www.bochk.com. Data collected would be used for recruitment purposes only. Applicants who do not hear from us within 8 weeks may consider their application unsuccessful and their data will be destroyed within 12 months of receipt.

